---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SkillTiers from '../components/SkillTiers.astro';
import { site, experience, education, explorations } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="关于我"
  description="榕（RickRone），软件工程师，3 年开发经验，专注复杂中后台、前端工程化与企业 AI 应用。"
>
  <article class="about wrap">
    <header class="about-head">
      <h1>关于我</h1>
      <p class="about-lead">榕 · 软件工程师 · 3 年开发经验</p>
    </header>

    <div class="about-intro">
      <p>
        我是榕（RickRone），安徽人，软件工程师，3 年开发经验。做过中后台、组件库、低代码、CMS 与跨端应用，现在在一家企业软件服务商负责中后台与前端基建，向全栈与 AI 应用方向延伸。
      </p>
      <p>
        我的工作大致分三块：把业务系统做稳（中后台、数据可视化、工作流），把重复的事工程化（Monorepo、组件库、CI/CD），把 AI 真正接进业务（模型接入、流式对话、智能分析）。
      </p>
      <p>
        正在补 Java / Spring Boot 与工业软件方向，目标是把前端工程能力延伸到系统集成与设备数据场景。
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="about-summary">
      主导过组件库、低代码平台与 AI 中台从 0 到 1 的建设；更擅长把重复的事收敛成可复用的基建。
    </p>

    <p class="about-availability">
      <span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      {site.availability}。<a href="/services/">查看求职与合作方式</a>
    </p>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>能力边界</h2>
      <div class="boundary-grid">
        <div class="boundary-item is-practice">
          <h3>有项目证据</h3>
          <p>Vue 3 / Vue 2、React、TypeScript、Node / BFF、uni-app、组件库与前端工程化、大模型 API 与 SSE 流式输出。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="boundary-item">
          <h3>有使用经验</h3>
          <p>Next.js、Express / Koa、Docker、MySQL 基础、GitLab CI / GitHub Actions。能完成常规开发与联调，复杂场景仍需协作。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="boundary-item is-learning">
          <h3>学习中</h3>
          <p>Java / Spring Boot、RAG、Agent / MCP、Modbus TCP / OPC UA、工业 AI 与 FDE 方向。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="boundary-note">
        网站只把有项目证据的能力写成「实战」；学习中的方向会明确标注，不包装成生产经验。
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>工作方式</h2>
      <div class="work-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="work-index">01</span>
          <h3>先拆问题</h3>
          <p>确认业务目标、用户、现有系统与约束，再讨论技术方案，不先堆技术名词。</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="work-index">02</span>
          <h3>写清取舍</h3>
          <p>方案文档里说明为什么选它、放弃了什么、风险在哪里，方便团队评审和后续维护。</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="work-index">03</span>
          <h3>交付闭环</h3>
          <p>类型、测试、文档、CI/CD 与上线后的可观测性一起考虑，而不是只把页面做出来。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>工作经历</h2>
      <ol class="timeline">
        {experience.map((job, index) => (
          <li class="stint">
            <p class="stint-time">
              {job.period}
              {index === 0 && <span class="badge">最近一段</span>}
            </p>
            <h3>{job.company}</h3>
            <p class="stint-role">{job.role}</p>
            <p class="stint-summary">{job.summary}</p>
            <ul>
              {job.points.map((point) => <li>{point}</li>)}
            </ul>
            <ul class="stint-tags" aria-label="关键词">
              {job.keywords.map((keyword) => <li>{keyword}</li>)}
            </ul>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>教育</h2>
      <p class="edu-line">{education.school} · {education.major} · {education.period}</p>
      <ul class="plain-list">
        {education.honors.map((honor) => <li>{honor}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>技术能力</h2>
      <p class="block-note">按真实使用程度分层，学习中的技术不会写成生产经验。</p>
      <SkillTiers layout="stack" />
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>技术探索</h2>
      <p class="block-note">以下方向处于学习、规划或验证阶段，不是已交付项目。</p>
      <ul class="explore-list">
        {explorations.map((item) => (
          <li>
            <span class="explore-status">{item.status}</span>
            <a href={`/lab/#${item.id}`}>{item.title}</a>
            <span class="explore-boundary">{item.boundary}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <p class="explore-more"><a href="/lab/">查看技术探索页</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>联系</h2>
      <p class="contact-line">
        邮件：<a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a><br />
        GitHub：<a href={site.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a><br />
        简历：<a href="/resume/">网页版简历</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5rem);
  }

  .about-head {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .about-head h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 2.8rem);
  }

  .about-lead {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .about-intro {
    max-width: 66ch;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .about-intro p + p {
    margin-top: 1em;
  }

  .about-summary {
    max-width: 54ch;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding: 0.15rem 0 0.15rem 1.1rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--seal);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 2vw, 1.28rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .about-availability {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .status-dot {
    flex: none;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--seal);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .about-availability a {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  .about-availability a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .block {
    margin-top: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4rem);
  }

  .block h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .block-note {
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }

  /* Ability boundary ---------------------------------------------- */
  .boundary-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem 2rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .boundary-item {
    padding-top: 0.9rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }

  .boundary-item.is-practice {
    border-top-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .boundary-item.is-learning {
    border-top-style: dashed;
    border-top-color: var(--seal);
  }

  .boundary-item h3 {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }

  .boundary-item p {
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .boundary-note {
    max-width: 64ch;
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--paper-raised);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* Work style ---------------------------------------------------- */
  .work-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.6rem 2rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .work-index {
    color: var(--seal);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .work-grid h3 {
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .work-grid p {
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* Timeline ------------------------------------------------------ */
  .timeline {
    position: relative;
    margin: 1.6rem 0 0;
    padding: 0 0 0 1.75rem;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .stint {
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .stint:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .stint::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.62em;
    left: calc(-1.75rem - 3.5px);
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .stint-time {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .badge {
    padding: 0.02em 0.4em;
    border: 1px solid var(--seal);
    border-radius: 2px;
    color: var(--seal);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .stint h3 {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .stint-role {
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .stint-summary {
    max-width: 64ch;
    margin-top: 0.55rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .stint ul {
    max-width: 64ch;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.2em;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .stint li + li,
  .plain-list li + li {
    margin-top: 0.35em;
  }

  .stint-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
    padding: 0 !important;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .stint-tags li {
    padding: 0.05em 0.45em;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 2px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .edu-line {
    margin-top: 1.3rem;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }

  .plain-list {
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.2em;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
  }

  /* Exploration list ---------------------------------------------- */
  .explore-list {
    margin: 1.3rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .explore-list li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4.5rem 12rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 0.8rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .explore-list li:first-child {
    border-top-color: var(--line-strong);
  }

  .explore-status {
    color: var(--seal);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .explore-list a {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  .explore-list a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .explore-boundary {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .explore-more {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }

  .explore-more a,
  .contact-line a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  .explore-more a:hover,
  .contact-line a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .contact-line {
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .boundary-grid,
    .work-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.2rem;
    }

    .explore-list li {
      grid-template-columns: 4.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .explore-boundary {
      grid-column: 2;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .explore-list li {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.2rem;
    }

    .explore-boundary {
      grid-column: 1;
    }
  }
</style>
